<title>LITHUANIA: MITSUBISHI EYES KLAIPEDA PORT, MAZEIKIU NAFTA.</title>
<headline>MITSUBISHI EYES KLAIPEDA PORT, MAZEIKIU NAFTA.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's European affairs ministry said on Monday that Japanese corporate giant Mitsubishi was considering taking part in the reconstruction of the port of Klaipeda and Mazeikiu Nafta oil refinery.</p>
<p>&quot;Mitsubishi (expressed)...its intention to participate in the reconstruction of Klaipeda sea-port and Mazeikiu Nafta,&quot; the ministry said in a statement after senior Mitsubishi officials met with European Affairs Minister Laima Andrikiene.</p>
<p>The statement added that Mitsubishi was also interested in investing in enterprises in the port.</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsrom, +370 2 22 35 18</p>
</text>
